// Root-cause diagnosis from the attempt ledger:
//
// Attempt 1 (40.8% best): used `next == "<<"`.  The Qwen tokenizer emits the
// open-delimiter as " <<" (space-prefixed), so `next == "<<"` NEVER fires.
