  "Use the symbolic variable names from the problem (e.g. n, p1, p2, m, k, frac, d, bill, etc.). " +
  "Work through every calculation carefully. " +
  "Express the final answer as one complete combined formula using those variable names " +
  "and standard arithmetic operators (+, -, *, /). " +
  "Example: if {n} people each spend {p1} plus {p2}, the answer formula is n * (p1 + p2).");

